Validation selects epoch3,NLL.366006;fixed fitting inference NLL improves
2.350038605to.395236061. Held-out accuracy.88,NLL.443415 exceeds the actual
initialization(.105accuracy)and coarse1NN(.84accuracy),but24of200digits are
